2024-01-01 open Assets:A
2024-01-01 open Assets:B
2024-01-01 open Assets:C
2024-01-01 open Assets:D

; A is 1 + 1e-30 (31 sig digits). rust_decimal rounds it to exactly 1, so a
; rust_decimal-only check sees 1 + (-1) = 0 and calls this balanced. Beancount
; keeps the 1e-30 and flags an imbalance; the decimal_exact side channel matches it.
2024-01-02 * "over-precise residual (must be flagged)"
  Assets:A   1.000000000000000000000000000001 USD
  Assets:B  -1 USD

; Plain 1 - 1 = 0. Genuinely balanced. Must NOT be flagged — i.e. the exact
; value of A's literal must not leak onto this unrelated amount equal to 1.
2024-01-03 * "plain balanced (must NOT be flagged — no value leak)"
  Assets:C   1 USD
  Assets:D  -1 USD
